OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze in
OL,4,Acentral Brighton
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have responded to a blaze
OL,7,Fin central Brighton.
OL,9,FEast Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid it was called to reports of a
OL,11,Fresidential building fire in York Place
OL,12,Fjust before 19:00 BST.
OL,14,FIt said six fire engines were on the
OL,15,Fscene and crews were using breathing
OL,16,Fapparatus and one main jet to tackle
OL,17,Fthe flames.
OL,19,FPeople were urged to avoid the area,
OL,20,Fwhich is near St Peter's Church.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
